<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Mattéo Guéguen — Aerospace Bracket Engineering Project</title>
  <style>
    :root { --bg: #0f172a; --card: #1e293b; --text: #f8fafc; --muted: #94a3b8; --accent: #38bdf8; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; padding: 2.5rem 1rem; }
    .container { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }
    header { border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.1rem; color: #fff; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; }
    .card h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.8rem 0 1.2rem; }
    .tag { background: #0f172a; color: var(--accent); padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .desc { color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
    .specs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; background: #0f172a; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; border: 1px solid #334155; }
    .spec-item strong { display: block; color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .spec-item span { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #fff; }
    
    /* Galerie des 3 photos côte à côte */
    .gallery-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; }
    .gallery-item { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.7rem; text-align: center; }
    .gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block; }
    .gallery-item p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; }

    @media (max-width: 750px) {
      .gallery-3, .specs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    footer { margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Mattéo Guéguen</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">4th-Year General Engineering Student — ECAM Rennes (Mechanical & Aerospace)</p>
    </header>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Aerospace Structural Bracket — Parametric CAD & Structural Optimization</h2>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Parametric CAD (SpaceClaim / Onshape)</span>
        <span class="tag">IronPython Scripting</span>
        <span class="tag">FEA Simulation (Ansys / SimScale)</span>
        <span class="tag">Structural Mass Optimization</span>
      </div>

      <p class="desc">
        Design and structural optimization of a load-bearing aerospace bracket across three iterative geometry variants. 
        The workflow combines automated parametric CAD generation using IronPython scripting with static Finite Element Analysis (FEA) 
        to minimize structural mass while ensuring safe Von Mises stress levels and stiffness under operational load cases.
      </p>

      <div class="specs">
        <div class="spec-item">
          <strong>Objective</strong>
          <span>Mass reduction & stress compliance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <strong>Methodology</strong>
          <span>Parametric scripting & iterative FEA</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <strong>Tools</strong>
          <span>SpaceClaim, Onshape, Ansys, SimScale</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="gallery-3">
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="model1.png" alt="Variant A - Initial Geometry">
          <p>Variant A — Initial Geometry</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="model2.png" alt="Variant B - Ribbed Iteration">
          <p>Variant B — Ribbed Iteration</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="model3.png" alt="Variant C - Optimized Final Design">
          <p>Variant C — Optimized Final Design</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <footer>
      <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:matteo.gueguen@ecam-ldb.com">matteo.gueguen@ecam-ldb.com</a> | Bruz, France</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>